  "title": "Red Hat Security Advisory: osbuild-composer security update",
  "description": "Multiple security vulnerabilities affecting the osbuild-composer image building service in Red Hat Enterprise Linux 8.4 have been addressed. These include issues in Go crypto libraries and related components leading to incorrect TLS certificate validation, denial of service via inefficient or recursive processing, privilege escalation, unauthorized information disclosure, and cross-site scripting. The update fixes these vulnerabilities to improve the security of the service.",
